{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An FMV interactive romantic comedy where your choices, timing, and luck shape every scene. Make decisions, roll the dice, and guide Kutay through a night that can turn into love or total chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s the dumbest thing three guys can do at a bar?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy. Pick one of them as the sacrificial lamb to hit on a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, who\u2019s the lucky &quot;sacrificial lamb&quot; tonight?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's you. Yeah,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.poster.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.webm?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/2ba3ef0296713da0aee268a77bce102c.mp4?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumped up by his friends, Kutay decides to make his move on Ay\u015fil, one of the bar\u2019s new regulars.  While Kutay\u2019s approach is anything but innocent, you can bet Ay\u015fil isn\u2019t exactly innocent either!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/de49e5db60a1b047d196eac045c7e9dd.poster.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/de49e5db60a1b047d196eac045c7e9dd.webm?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FMV interactive romantic comedy game, their first encounter kicks off a night that can twist into flirtation, fear, or full-blown chaos, all depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, Kutay might discover things about himself, confront unexpected emotions, and realize that sometimes people are far more complicated than they seem. He could end up in a fight with strangers, caught between two powerful feelings, or screaming his head off. Sometimes he can\u2019t take his eyes off someone; other times, he\u2019s risking it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.poster.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.webm?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.mp4?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But isn\u2019t that what love\u2019s always like, in a way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.poster.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.webm?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.mp4?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this wild ride of a night, Kutay\u2019s got only one friend by his side: you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching, dynamic story progression driven by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 decisions that can dramatically change how scenes play out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dice mechanic that adds an element of luck and tension to key moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization options, allowing for multiple playthroughs and different approaches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K resolution live-action visuals shot like a cinematic film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time, directed action scenes with integrated Quick Time Events (QTEs) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story map you can track to see the paths you\u2019ve taken.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice impacts the \u201clove meter\u201d, reflecting Kutay\u2019s emotional journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/eb2ccc767f4e28c242a872286acfbdde.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Kutay navigate the dangers of romance and fear to reach a happy ending, or will your choices lead him to a darker fate? Dive into &quot;Love: Fall in Death&quot; and explore a narrative where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.stea