m_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.poster.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.webm?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/c50a29146be719f4c5635eebb954381d.mp4?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But isn\u2019t that what love\u2019s always like, in a way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.poster.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.webm?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/131c6248e86c26736ea3e924fa79fa40.mp4?t=1772155901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this wild ride of a night, Kutay\u2019s got only one friend by his side: you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching, dynamic story progression driven by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 decisions that can dramatically change how scenes play out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dice mechanic that adds an element of luck and tension to key moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization options, allowing for multiple playthroughs and different approaches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K resolution live-action visuals shot like a cinematic film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time, directed action scenes with integrated Quick Time Events (QTEs) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story map you can track to see the paths you\u2019ve taken.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice impacts the \u201clove meter\u201d, reflecting Kutay\u2019s emotional journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/extras/eb2ccc767f4e28c242a872286acfbdde.avif?t=1772155901\" width=600 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Kutay navigate the dangers of romance and fear to reach a happy ending, or will your choices lead him to a darker fate? Dive into &quot;Love: Fall in Death&quot; and explore a narrative where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SNR Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077540/fb1ff344a46a8a57edf1ace72f9a41321ea3c19b/header.jpg?t=1772155901","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The developers describe the content as follows:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStrong language, violence","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077540/1286616450/a5d19e1f450f2dfba21e4344e8f14745e2c91d47/1762617499/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766504099","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077540/1286616450/a5d19e1f450f2dfba21e4344e8f14745e2c91d47/1762617499/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766504099","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077540/1286616450/a5d19e1f450f2dfba21e4344e8f14